[00:00.000] 作曲 : DJ Novus
[00:01.000] 编曲 : DJ Novus/Markus Schaffarzyk
[00:42.020]I'm loving living every single day (我是如此的享受每一天的生活)
[00:46.920]but sometimes I feel so (但有时才有这种感受)
[00:52.320]I hope to find a little peace of mind (想要寻找一个宁静的心灵空间)
[00:57.520]and I just want to know (寻找一个答案)
[01:02.770]And who can heal those tiny broken hearts (谁能安抚那些破碎的心)
[01:08.070]and what are we to be (我们将何去何从)
[01:13.520]Where is home on the milkyway of stars (在广阔的星空下何处寻到我的家)
[01:18.720]I dry my eyes again (我只得再一次地擦干泪眼)
[01:23.970]In my dreams I am not so far away from home (梦中我从未曾远离家园)
[01:28.670]What am I in a world so far away from home (现实中却如此远离家园)
[01:33.970]All my life all the time so far away from home (有生以来我都远离家园)
[01:39.220]without you I will be so far away from home (没有你的相伴我依然远离家园)
